/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 5.2 Classes, Instances and the Self Parameter) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Class Definition: A user-defined blueprint from which individual objects) Tj
T*
(\(instances\) are instantiated: class ClassName: ...) Tj
T*
(* The __init__ Constructor Method: Special dunder \(double-underscore\) initialization) Tj
T*
(method invoked automatically upon object creation to initialize instance attributes.) Tj
T*
(* The self Parameter: Explicit reference to the current instance invoking the method.) Tj
T*
(Must be the first parameter of any instance method.) Tj
T*
(* Instance vs Class Attributes:) Tj
T*
(- Instance Attributes: Variables bound to self \(self.x = 10\) unique to each instance.) Tj
T*
(- Class \(Static\) Attributes: Variables declared directly within class body shared) Tj
T*
(collectively across all instances.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
