(* Classes encapsulate state and behavior; self explicitly passes the instance) Tj
T*
(reference.) Tj
T*
(* Name mangling \(__var -> _Class__var\) protects private variables from subclass) Tj
T*
(collision.) Tj
T*
(* super\(\) enables clean cooperative multiple inheritance via MRO.) Tj
T*
